--TEST--
a name written after a property's modifier is its type or another modifier, so it is offered the types a bare name reaches beside the member words, and never the modifier already written, `rule:ide/completion-offers-only-what-the-compiler-derived`
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace Shop;

class Money {}

class Cart {
    public <|>
}
--REQUEST--
completion prefix=p
--EXPECT--
private keyword
protected keyword
